  m_Name: IntroPage_02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroPageData
  pageTitle: The Junkyards
  pageBody: 'When the war finally ended, the machines were not completely destroyed.


    Across
    the world, abandoned battlefields, ruined factories, and buried machine nests
    remained. The survivors gave these places a simple name:


    Junkyards.'
